[node name="Info1" parent="InfoBoards" index="0" instance=ExtResource("11_info")]
position = Vector2(1817, 480)
description = "SIMPLE MACHINES
Everyday problems are solved by simple machines.
This see-saw is a LEVER. Hop on the LEFT arm and press E -
a heavy boulder drops on the far side and CATAPULTS you up!"

[node name="Info2" parent="InfoBoards" index="1" instance=ExtResource("11_info")]
position = Vector2(1244, 480)
description = "EASIER AND FASTER
One machine helps. MORE machines together make
work even easier and faster. Ride the pulley
platform up, then deploy the ramp!"

[node name="Info3" parent="InfoBoards" index="2" instance=ExtResource("11_info")]
position = Vector2(143, 480)
description = "COMPLEX MACHINE: SCISSORS
A complex machine combines more than one simple
machine. Scissors = SCREW + WEDGE."

[node name="Info4" parent="InfoBoards" index="3" instance=ExtResource("11_info")]
position = Vector2(423, 480)
description = "COMPLEX MACHINE: AXE
Axe = LEVER + WEDGE.
The handle is the lever, the blade is the wedge."

[node name="Info5" parent="InfoBoards" index="4" instance=ExtResource("11_info")]
position = Vector2(589, 385)
description = "MORE COMPLEX MACHINES
Wheelbarrow = LEVER + SCREW + WHEEL AND AXLE.
Ladder = INCLINED PLANE + SCREW."

[node name="Info6" parent="InfoBoards" index="5" instance=ExtResource("11_info")]
position = Vector2(790, 384)
description = "SUSTAINABLE MACHINES
Bicycle = GEAR + SCREW + WHEEL AND AXLE.
It is durable, cost-effective, easy and safe to use,
needs NO fossil fuel and makes NO pollution!"

[node name="Info7" parent="InfoBoards" index="6" instance=ExtResource("11_info")]
position = Vector2(3500, 480)
description = "BUILD THE COMPLEX MACHINE
Switch on the LEVER, PULLEY, GEARS and RAMP
stations. Many simple machines working together
make ONE complex machine. Power it up!"

